  "title": "Transocean Ltd. Announces Contract Awards Totaling $185 Million",
  "summary": "STEINHAUSEN, Switzerland, June 16, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Transocean Ltd. (NYSE: RIG) (“Transocean”) today announced contract awards for two of its harsh environment semisubmersibles. In aggregate, the fixtures represent approximately $185 million in firm contract backlog.",
